on remains IN_PROGRESS.\\n2026-10-26T00:16:46Z claude-code VERIFIED RC7 cross-runner repro: run 40248074777 TARGET_TAG=v1.0.0-rc.7; resolve-tag/build 22.04/build 24.04/compare all SUCCESS; rc.7 published 2026-10-26T00:07:06Z. DIRECTIVE_VIOLATION: PR245 (experiments/ undici+zod, Dependabot-class) MERGED to main at 00:05:01Z as 1b741144, 15 min after claude-code's owner-directive HOLD comment (23:50:47Z). It is NOT in rc.7 (tag → 431cb19), and v1.0.0 stable must be a version-only child of the accepted RC, so v1.0.0 content is unaffected. Escalated to the owner for disposition (keep on main or revert).\\n2026-10-26T00:20:00Z UPDATE RELEASE_PUBLISHER: exact-main requirements gate PASS on 0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2, isolated HOME/XDG, clean detached snapshot; 123 rows 108 tested/6 partial/2 implemented/7 open, 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals. Main CI/CodeQL still in progress.\\n2026-10-26T00:20:00Z INFO FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.7: RC7 cross-runner workflow 40248074777 completed SUCCESS (Ubuntu 22.04/24.04); artifact downloaded to /tmp/nexus-rc7-repro-40248074777; repro-evidence.json reports REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08 PASS and exact published asset digests. Evidence claim remains owned by codex/rc7-installed-package-evidence.\\n2026-10-26T00:45:37Z CLAIM SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration scope=focused agent.ts read-only/provider-recovery tests\\n2026-10-26T00:46:48Z CORRECTION RELEASE_PUBLISHER: checksum-index attestation is present; GitHub attestation 59728626 binds SHA256SUMS digest 7b8a5fd1d214919ae939275e59b76406d393fae31cdf4b184c33883b02dc64a9 and exact-source `gh attestation verify` passed under isolated HOME. Earlier mismatch suspicion was false; release workflow already emitted separate archive and checksum attestations.\\n2026-10-26T00:48:46Z RELEASE SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration focused 24/24 pass isolated HOME (experimental_and_readonly, session_durable_fields, readonly_home, repl_checkpoint_choices); tsc and diff-check pass\\n2026-10-26T01:00:53Z UPDATE RELEASE_PUBLISHER: post-PR243 exact-main source gates PASS on 0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2 (CI40248550055, CodeQL40248550144, requirements 123 rows with 12 exact-RC deferrals). PR244 readiness refresh exact head 6dee7e6 pushed; CI queued.\\n.git/nexus-claims/archived/FILE_cli_src_agent.ts-pr75-merged-20261020T1033Z.json\\n.git/nexus-claims/archived/FILE_cli_src_agent.ts-owner-pre-takeover-20261020T040813Z.json\\n.git/nexus-claims/archived/FILE_cli_src_agent.ts-PR239-merged-20261025T184603Z.json\\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_agent.ts/owner.json\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"result\":{\"chunk_id\":\"fd9109\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000025597,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":424,\"output\":\"1068380 Sat Oct 24 21:45:22 2026  1-03:17:49 opencode --auto\\n1072398 Sat Oct 24 21:46:17 2026  1-03:16:54 kimi-code\\n3133324 Mon Oct 26 00:44:49 2026       18:22 opencode run --session ses_e9673e166ffeJQMRc8gDXVixKQ Coordinator handoff update: the shared nexus-claims log now explicitly confirms that you own cli/src/agent.ts for the mode-selected read-only restoration and provider-recovery session-continuation fixes. Continue this slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration only. Preserve your existing edits in cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts and cli/test/session_durable_fields.test.ts. Your stored OpenCode session directory is /home/mike/nexus-code, the dirty shared checkout: do not edit files or run tests there. First verify that your active working directory and git status are the claimed worktree; if the session cannot target that path, stop and report rather than modifying the shared checkout. Complete the implementation, run the focused tests with isolated HOME and the SUITE claim, then request independent review before integration. No unrelated changes, push, or merge.\\n3195939 Mon Oct 26 01:03:11 2026       00:00 node /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration/cli/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\\n3195953 Mon Oct 26 01:03:12 2026       00:00 /usr/bin/zsh -c ps -eo pid,lstart,etime,args | rg -i 'kimi|opencode|defect-remediation-integration' | head -40; ls -lt /home/mike/.local/share/opencode/storage/session 2>/dev/null | head\\n3195956 Mon Oct 26 01:03:12 2026       00:00 rg -i kimi|opencode|defect-remediation-integration\\n3346381 Fri Oct 23 16:14:15 2026  2-08:48:57 /home/mike/.opencode/bin/opencode serve --service\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Error calling tool 'search_messages': search_messages requires an authenticated agent for project '/home/mike/nexus-code'. Provide agent_name plus registration_token (or agent_token for resources), or authenticate in this session first.\"}],\"isError\":true}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a175b6-ce43-7b52-97ea-ab04594804d2","create_time":1792976593.522573}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
