{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:11:12.102Z","ordinal":366558,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175be-0730-75f1-8284-515d0c4291f4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adea8ae9a3481a0ac68f70334f92b7a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Kimi is not waiting for the `agent.ts` handoff: the claim is assigned to Kimi, its OpenCode session is live, and the implementation and regression-test diff has grown to 217 insertions. I logged a request for a checkpoint at the next safe boundary. The latest edits still need focused tests and independent review; earlier passing tests do not cover this diff. I did not take over or run overlapping tests.\n\nPR #244 remains on `0542312a` with Node 22 and Node 24 checks in progress; its other required checks pass. The Ubuntu desktop has all five required terminal environments and RC7 installed, so it is prepared for the matrix once the exact candidate RC is available. The manual matrix remains incomplete.\n\nRC7 is still unaccepted, and stable v1.0.0 has not been published. Held-out qualification remains dependent on independent custodian acceptance."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792977070633,"completed_at_ms":1792977072102}}
