{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:18:28.735Z","ordinal":366827,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a175c9-997f-7643-8a67-d4509fdae7c1","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed the stated snapshot at HEAD `e5a1402d9851d005e447c306844374e712529dd9`, against the same base. The four-file diff hash matches `1757ab36a6d535b1e0e039df01c09c30d7ea8ece6e0ad6fc80061e3f741e3af6`.\n\n`setApprovalMode` clears `config.fullAccess` for non-auto modes at [agent.ts:1276–1278](/home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration/cli/src/agent.ts:1276), but never updates `AuthorityAdmissionEngine.fullAccess`, which is initialized from the original config at [agent.ts:1127–1128](/home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration/cli/src/agent.ts:1127). The engine’s read-only admission check precedes its full-access bypass, but resource confinement independently returns unrestricted when `fullAccess` remains true at [authority.ts:612–614](/home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration/cli/src/core/authority.ts:612). Thus a session started with full access can switch to read-only while retaining unrestricted resource confinement for otherwise permitted reads. The checkpoint fallback has the same gap: `setCheckpointReadOnlyFallback` updates read-only posture but does not clear the engine’s full-access state ([agent.ts:1330–1335](/home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration/cli/src/agent.ts:1330)).\n\nSynchronize the engine’s full-access flag with the effective posture, keeping it disabled while read-only and restoring it only when the configured mode permits. Add a regression that starts with `fullAccess: true`, enters read-only (including fallback), and verifies confinement no longer allows out-of-workspace reads. I did not edit files or run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a175c8-706c-78b3-b68b-5c73a47471ae","create_time":1792977508.735374}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18058}}
