{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:21:34.164Z","ordinal":367001,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175c8-706c-78b3-b68b-5c73a47471ae","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adeab1cfb1481a0a4291fa060793856","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Kimi was waiting on a handoff that the current claims record already shows as complete: Kimi owns `agent.ts`. I clarified that and sent the outstanding independent review finding.\n\nKimi has since updated the read-only/full-access handling and added a regression for out-of-workspace reads. The latest focused checks passed, including provider recovery (17/17), agent/session tests (13/13), TypeScript, and diff validation. I’ve requested a fresh independent review of that exact diff; it is still pending. No push or merge has happened. RC7 remains unaccepted."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792977693008,"completed_at_ms":1792977694164}}
