, with branch v1/defect-remediation-integration and scope for this exact read-only/provider recovery slice. No separate agent.ts handoff is pending in the current owner.json. Please confirm whether you are blocked by another specific active owner or proceed with your owned slice. Independent read-only review of diff 1757ab36a6d535b1e0e039df01c09c30d7ea8ece6e0ad6fc80061e3f741e3af6 returned CHANGES_REQUIRED: setApprovalMode clears config.fullAccess but does not synchronize AuthorityAdmissionEngine.fullAccess; the engine resource-confinement path can therefore remain unrestricted after switching a full-access session to read-only. setCheckpointReadOnlyFallback also fails to clear engine full-access. Fix by syncing engine fullAccess with effective posture, keep disabled while read-only and restore only when configured mode permits. Add regressions starting fullAccess:true, switching to read-only and checkpoint fallback, and verify out-of-workspace reads are denied. Keep existing scope/claim; no rebase, push, merge, or unrelated files. Before focused tests, acquire SUITE claim; isolate HOME/XDG per project rules. Then report exact diff hash, test commands/results, and release SUITE.\n3280701    6852       00:01 /usr/bin/zsh -lc ps -eo pid,ppid,etime,args | rg 'opencode run --session ses_e9673e166ffeJQMRc8gDXVixKQ|kimi-code'; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration remote -v; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration log --oneline --decorate --graph --left-right origin/main...HEAD | head -n 45; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-remediation-integration merge-base HEAD origin/main; gh pr list --state all --head v1/defect-remediation-integration --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,url --limit 10; gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,baseRefName,headRefOid,url --limit 30\n3281105 3280701       00:00 rg opencode run --session ses_e9673e166ffeJQMRc8gDXVixKQ|kimi-code\norigin\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexu