2>/dev/null; git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD | head -5; echo \"HEAD=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\"; git diff --stat HEAD^ HEAD; git status --porcelain | wc -l\n0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2\nf15618d fix(agent): restore mode-selected read-only and recovery continuity\ne5a1402 feat(config): track mode-selected read-only\na391b2a fix(doctor): validate schema-2 session journals\nac87272 fix(client): fall back from unknown provider codes\nb933cb4 fix(repl): sanitize approval review text\nHEAD=f15618d5cbb36af79581bdd3912357a6abd5b0ee\n cli/src/agent.ts                           | 109 ++++++++++++++++++++++----\n cli/src/types.ts                           |   2 +-\n cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cli/test/session_durable_fields.test.ts    |  30 ++++++++\n 4 files changed, 242 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)\n0\n> build · deepseek-flash\nIntegration-preparation step completed.\n\n## Local commit\n- **Commit SHA:** `f15618d5cbb36af79581bdd3912357a6abd5b0ee`\n- **Parent:** `e5a1402d9851d005e447c306844374e712529dd9`\n- **Branch:** `v1/defect-remediation-integration`\n- **Commit diff identity:** `9ee90f3711ce51d3e4d0dae7c8a443359f6afa1e193a7f969f867c0bf1b30138` (the reviewed snapshot)\n- **Subject:** `fix(agent): restore mode-selected read-only and recovery continuity`\n- **Files (only these four):**\n  - `cli/src/agent.ts`\n  - `cli/src/types.ts`\n  - `cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts`\n  - `cli/test/session_durable_fields.test.ts`\n\n`git status` is clean after the commit. No push, rebase, or merge was performed, and no prior commits were amended.\n\n## History check\n- Branch HEAD before the commit was `e5a1402`; no commits had been added since it, so there were no foreign commits to preserve within this local slice.\n- Current `origin/main` is `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`; the branch is 29 ahead / 16 behind. The committed slice is isolated as a single local commit for cherry-pick/reapply.\n\n## Evidence recorded\n`nexus-claims.log` now records the commit SHA, parent, branch, diff SHA-256, exact four-file scope, independent review ACCEPT, and the local-only/no-push status.\n\n## Claims released\n- `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts`\n- `DEFECT_REMEDIATION_INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE_20261025`\n\nBoth release actions were logged. No edits were made after the commit.\n\n## Validation backing the accepted snapshot\n- `provider_recovery_agent.test.ts`: **17/17**, exit 0\n- `experimental_and_readonly.test.ts` + `session_durable_fields.test.ts`: **13/13**, exit 0\n- `readonly_home.test.ts` + `repl_checkpoint_choices.test.ts`: **11/11**, exit 0\n- Named sidecar checkpoint-fallback regression: **1/1**, exit 0\n- `tsc --noEmit`: exit 0\n- `git diff --check`: exit 0\n- Independent reviewer ACCEPT for exact diff SHA `9ee90f37…`.\n\nNo real blocker remains for this slice. The pre-existing worktree-bound `recoverFromTaskState` reset behavior remains documented as a separate follow-up.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":321,"nanos":783572422}},"started_at_ms":1792977780771,"completed_at_ms":1792978102555}}
