de/.git/nexus-claims.log; gh run view 40252055456 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '.jobs[] | select(.name==\"linux-x86_64\") | {status,conclusion,steps:[.steps[] | select(.status==\"in_progress\") | {name,startedAt}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/defect-remediation-integration...origin/main [ahead 29, behind 16]\nf15618d (HEAD -> v1/defect-remediation-integration) fix(agent): restore mode-selected read-only and recovery continuity\n cli/src/agent.ts                           | 109 ++++++++++++++++++++++----\n cli/src/types.ts                           |   2 +-\n cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cli/test/session_durable_fields.test.ts    |  30 ++++++++\n 4 files changed, 242 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)\ncommit f15618d5cbb36af79581bdd3912357a6abd5b0ee\nAuthor:     Mike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\nAuthorDate: Mon Oct 26 01:28:04 2026 +0000\nCommit:     Mike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\nCommitDate: Mon Oct 26 01:28:04 2026 +0000\n\n    fix(agent): restore mode-selected read-only and recovery continuity\n    \n    Mode-selected and runtime read-only now stay enforced across the bridge,\n    authority engine, extension managers and workspace/shell reconstruction, while\n    a deliberate /mode change can leave them. The transient checkpoint fallback no\n    longer leaks into the configured posture, and full-access resource confinement\n    is disabled while read-only is effective.\n    \n    Session continuation restores provider recovery, the operation envelope and an\n    untrusted change baseline; durable task recovery preserves the same fields and\n    reset clears transient recovery. Focused regressions cover explicit,\n    mode-selected and runtime read-only, fallback release, manager sync, full-access\n    confinement and recovery fields.\nCLAIM_RELEASED /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_agent.ts/owner.json\nCLAIM_RELEASED /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/DEFECT_REMEDIATION_INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE_20261025/owner.json\n2026-10-26T01:15:41Z CLAIM SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration scope=provider_recovery_agent plus final focused validation\n2026-10-26T01:16:43Z RELEASE SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration diff_sha256=1757ab36a6d535b1e0e039df01c09c30d7ea8ece6e0ad6fc80061e3f741e3af6; commands: provider_recovery_agent (exit0 17/17 log=/tmp/opencode/provider_recovery_agent-final-20261026T011541Z.log), experimental_and_readonly+session_durable_fields (exit0 13/13 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-readonly-recovery-final.log), readonly_home+repl_checkpoint_choices (exit0 11/11 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-readonly-final.log), named sidecar checkpoint fallback (exit0 1/1 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-sidecar-final.log), tsc (exit0 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-tsc-final.log), git diff --check (exit0 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-diffcheck-final.log); isolated HOME/XDG per run; no full suite\n2026-10-26T01:16:43Z REVIEW_UPDATE plan05_readonly_review: current diff_sha256 remains 1757ab36a6d535b1e0e039df01c09c30d7ea8ece6e0ad6fc80061e3f741e3af6 after final manager/churn fixes; reviewer snapshot is current. Independent review requests no edits; evidence logs recorded, SUITE released. No push/merge/rebase.\n2026-10-26T01:16:46Z UPDATE RELEASE_PUBLISHER: PR244 exact base/head rechecked; Node22/24 test jobs pending, CodeQL/JS-TS pass, independent ACCEPT; local follow-up e4c70bf plus unstaged doc correction recorded, not pushed. Kimi remediation/SUITE and independent review remain owner-controlled; no takeover. RC7 not accepted; stable gates remain open.\n2026-10-26T01:21:14Z RELEASE SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration diff_sha256=9ee90f3711ce51d3e4d0dae7c8a443359f6afa1e193a7f969f867c0bf1b30138; provider_recovery_agent exit=0 17/17 log=/tmp/opencode/provider_recovery_agent-final2.log; slice exit=0 13/13 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-final2.log; tsc exit=0; diff-check exit=0; isolated HOME/XDG; SUITE released\n2026-10-26T01:21:14Z REVIEW_UPDATE plan05_readonly_review: new diff_sha256=9ee90f3711ce51d3e4d0dae7c8a443359f6afa1e193a7f969f867c0bf1b30138 adds AuthorityAdmissionEngine.fullAccess synchronization (disabled in read-only/fallback; restored in auto only when configured fullAccess was true) plus regression asserting out-of-workspace confine denial. Previous hash 1757ab... superseded. No push/merge/rebase. Please re-review this snapshot.\n2026-10-26T01:25:01Z REVIEW_ACCEPT plan05_readonly_review branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration base=e5a1402d9851d005e447c306844374e712529dd9 diff_sha256=9ee90f3711ce51d3e4d0dae7c8a443359f6afa1e193a7f969f867c0bf1b30138; prior fullAccess/read-only bypass finding resolved by synchronizing engine posture; regressions cover out-of-workspace denial and fallback/mode restoration; reviewer ran no tests; implementer evidence remains 17+13+11+1 focused tests, tsc and diff-check PASS. No push/merge/rebase; awaiting owner local commit and claim release for current-main requalification.\n2026-10-26T01:28:11Z INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE_COMMIT commit=f15618d5cbb36af79581bdd3912357a6abd5b0ee parent=e5a1402d9851d005e447c306844374e712529dd9 branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration base=0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2 diff_sha256=9ee90f3711ce51d3e4d0dae7c8a443359f6afa1e193a7f969f867c0bf1b30138 files=cli/src/agent.ts,cli/src/types.ts,cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts,cli/test/session_durable_fields.test.ts independent_review=ACCEPT; local-only commit, no push/rebase/merge; releasing FILE_cli_src_agent.ts and DEFECT_REMEDIATION_INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE_20261025 for owner cherry-pick/reapply on origin/main 0542312\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli test\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T01:22:32Z\"}]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":901119469}},"started_at_ms":1792978122402,"completed_at_ms":179297812