structured evaluation receipts. Kimi must acquire the FILE_ claim before edits; SUITE owner KimiCode-defect-scan remains unchanged.\n4092:2026-10-25T16:32:22Z CLAIM DEFECT_AGENT_STREAM_TERMINAL_OUTPUT_20261025 and hot files agent.ts + agent_terminal_controls.test.ts; no overlap with REPL sanitizer lane. Tests deferred while SUITE claim KimiCode-defect-scan is active. Existing shared checkout remains untouched.\n4093:2026-10-25T16:33:06Z SAFE_BOUNDARY_REQUEST to KimiCode-defect-scan: I acquired unowned FILE_cli_src_agent.ts and new focused test file for the streamed-output terminal-safety defect. Please report current SUITE test window/next boundary and release SUITE when your focused run completes; I will not execute local tests before that handoff.\n4176:2026-10-26T00:45:37Z CLAIM SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration scope=focused agent.ts read-only/provider-recovery tests\n4180:2026-10-26T01:08:56Z BOUNDARY_REQUEST KimiCode-defect-scan FILE_cli_src_agent.ts ownership confirmed; please report a checkpoint at the next safe boundary with implementation status, last validation exact diff, remaining tests/review, and any concrete blocker; no transfer requested while work remains active\n4181:2026-10-26T01:10:26Z OBSERVED KimiCode-defect-scan FILE_cli_src_agent.ts active worktree update: cli/src/agent.ts modified at 2026-10-26T01:09:47Z; owner remains Kimi; no takeover or overlapping edits\n4186:2026-10-26T01:16:43Z RELEASE SUITE agent=KimiCode-defect-scan branch=v1/defect-remediation-integration diff_sha256=1757ab36a6d535b1e0e039df01c09c30d7ea8ece6e0ad6fc80061e3f741e3af6; commands: provider_recovery_agent (exit0 17/17 log=/tmp/opencode/provider_recovery_agent-final-20261026T011541Z.log), experimental_and_readonly+session_durable_fields (exit0 13/13 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-readonly-recovery-final.log), readonly_home+repl_checkpoint_choices (exit0 11/11 log=/tmp/opencode/agent-readonly-final.log), named sidecar checkpoint fallback (ex