026-10-25T03:55:09Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"}\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"assets\":[{\"digest\":\"sha256:8f4ca814fc41ea2ecd4f18f745202f57b3aabe3fb1573659e579f59cf6f5be88\",\"name\":\"compatibility.json\",\"size\":764},{\"digest\":\"sha256:5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302\",\"name\":\"install.sh\",\"size\":10335},{\"digest\":\"sha256:367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a\",\"name\":\"nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.7.tar.gz\",\"size\":4847852},{\"digest\":\"sha256:03084d01d9167833461dd43f99a2e683b64a1607a5ffc9ccfd1a54c8e8e65761\",\"name\":\"sbom.cdx.json\",\"size\":163389},{\"digest\":\"sha256:ea2399c8217c9dc3f853e591fdfc0e50f0d383346a24e168677378eb277afef1\",\"name\":\"sbom.cdx.json.sha256\",\"size\":80},{\"digest\":\"sha256:03084d01d9167833461dd43f99a2e683b64a1607a5ffc9ccfd1a54c8e8e65761\",\"name\":\"sbom.json\",\"size\":163389},{\"digest\":\"sha256:28ee4b510761d613193e254d60d694a2f315d2f059d93914e5004ff2f23e7049\",\"name\":\"sbom.json.sha256\",\"size\":76},{\"digest\":\"sha256:7b8a5fd1d214919ae939275e59b76406d393fae31cdf4b184c33883b02dc64a9\",\"name\":\"SHA256SUMS\",\"size\":189},{\"digest\":