{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T01:59:07.594Z","ordinal":369123,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175e8-4eff-7233-b46c-53eb01e9d36a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adeb3e9de7881a098bbc7e7dd80375b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I handed the `cli/src/agent.ts` claim to **KimiCode-defect-scan** at safe boundary and recorded the branch, worktree, and next steps in the shared claims ledger. PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) is at `a2aa9b1`; its Node 22/24 suites are still running. Once they finish, the handoff calls for merging current `origin/main` normally and rerunning checks on that updated head.\n\nI also refreshed the existing readiness report in local commit `cf5ef34`. Independent review accepted it, and `git diff --check` passed. I haven’t opened a PR for the report yet because the current-main and PR #246 full suites are already running.\n\nCurrent release state: `origin/main` is `62e541c`; CodeQL passed, but main CI is still running. RC7 remains an unaccepted prerelease. The Ubuntu desktop check still shows OpenRouter disconnected; Issue #1 has no custodian response; the terminal matrix remains 0/15. **Acceptance is IN_PROGRESS; no stable v1.0.0 release is published.**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792979945917,"completed_at_ms":1792979947594}}
