{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:00:49.626Z","ordinal":369184,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175ef-1acf-7001-bccf-5cf91674c854","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adeb450650481a086cf4ebd56d2a665","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**Progress made:** PR #246’s Node 22 and Node 24 suites have passed. The Linux package job is still running. I transferred the `agent.ts` claim to Kimi with the safe-boundary handoff recorded; after all checks finish, the next step is to merge current `origin/main` normally and rerun checks on the updated PR head.\n\n`origin/main` remains `62e541c`. Its CodeQL passed, but main CI is still running, so source gates are not fully green yet. The readiness refresh is committed locally as `cf5ef34` and independently reviewed **ACCEPT**; I’m holding its PR until these full-suite runs finish to avoid overlapping CI.\n\nRelease acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. RC7 is still unaccepted; OpenRouter is disconnected, held-out custody has no response, and the human terminal matrix remains 0/15. No stable v1.0.0 release is published."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792980048429,"completed_at_ms":1792980049626}}
