{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:02:00.356Z","ordinal":369245,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175f0-a051-7293-adf5-5b3650d75759","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adeb497a84481a0b84a5cf5bdc85028","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The Node 22/24 suites have now passed on both current-main CI and PR #246. Their Linux packaging jobs are still running. I also checked the desktop’s configured local endpoint: nothing is listening at `127.0.0.1:1234`, so there is no local-gateway qualification evidence from that host; OpenRouter remains disconnected."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792980119687,"completed_at_ms":1792980120356}}
