{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:02:03.090Z","ordinal":369247,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adeb498551081a08abb4658bcf2eafc","status":"completed","call_id":"call_9fc3ddd6bf1d49928c611a70c218cc41","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, os, pathlib, tempfile, datetime\\np=pathlib.Path('/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json')\\nd=json.loads(p.read_text())\\nnow=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(timespec='seconds').replace('+00:00','Z')\\nd['updated_at']=now\\nd['status']=('Current main origin/main 62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074: CodeQL40255529667 PASS; Node22/24 CLI suites passed in CI40255529634; Linux x86_64 packaging job still running. PR246 head a2aa9b1 based on 0542312: Node22/24 suites, CodeQL and JS/TS passed; Linux x86_64 job in progress. FILE_cli_src_agent.ts handed to KimiCode-defect-scan at 01:54Z; after all exact-head checks finish, merge current main normally and rerun checks. RC7 remains latest unaccepted prerelease; cross-runner run40248074777 and ChatGPT gpt-6-luna 3/3 passed for RC7 only. Fresh Ubuntu desktop provider status: ChatGPT connected; OpenRouter disconnected; configured localhost:1234 endpoint refused connection, so no local-gateway qualification evidence on this host. Issue #1 remains open with no custodian response; held-out qualification has not started. Terminal matrix 0/15; T2/T3/T4, standalone/provider, exact-RC qualification, independent acceptance remain unresolved. Stable v1.0.0 not published; acceptance IN_PROGRESS; publication authorization remains granted and gated.')\\nfd,tmp=tempfile.mkstemp(prefix='owner.json.',dir=p.parent)\\nwith os.fdopen(fd,'w') as f: json.dump(d,f,indent=2); f.write('\\\\n')\\nos.replace(tmp,p)\\nprint(now)\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"max_output_tokens\":100});text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthro