{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:06:18.181Z","ordinal":369444,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a175f4-a1f3-7df2-a430-b9d22a63e52f","turn_id":"01a175f4-a1f3-7df2-a430-b9d22a63e52f","last_agent_message":"Kimi still owns the `agent.ts` integration step. Both Linux test jobs remain active, so the exact-head CI gate is still pending.\n\nI ran a read-only merge preflight against current `main` (`62e541c`) and PR #246 (`a2aa9b1`): it found no file conflicts. I recorded that result in the claims log; no branch was changed. Kimi can use it after the active checks finish.","started_at":1792980328,"completed_at":1792980378,"duration_ms":49224,"time_to_first_token_ms":1338}}
