{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:07:28.410Z","ordinal":369503,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175f6-123b-7b40-b2ba-4195eb9a3260","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a175f6-123b-7b40-b2ba-4195eb9a3260","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adeb5db5ee081a0bf050bee8f25b19e","usage":{"input_tokens":97760,"cached_input_tokens":94464,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":552,"reasoning_output_tokens":456,"total_tokens":98312},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":286544,"cached_input_tokens":279936,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2019,"reasoning_output_tokens":1539,"total_tokens":288563},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":6741402780,"cached_input_tokens":6668908672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":19422154,"reasoning_output_tokens":11262911,"total_tokens":6760824934}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:07:29.873Z","ordinal":369504,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a175f6-123b-7b40-b2ba-4195eb9a3260","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a05da714-ea7d-48ea-b240-5e601f93416c","process_id":"11379","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 246 --json title,body,files,reviews --jq '{title,body,files:[.files[].path],reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 246 --json title,body,files,reviews --jq '{title,body,files:[.files[].path],reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Apply the effective read-only posture selected by the launch mode immediately to the bridge, authority admission engine, knowledge graph, and extension managers.\\n- Preserve mode-selected read-only as a deliberate, changeable mode while keeping explicit `--read-only` launches locked.\\n- Port the accepted session recovery regression into the current `durable_continuity.test.ts` suite, since the older test file was removed from current main.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `npm run build` — passed.\\n- `test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts` — 8/8 passed.\\n- Focused durable session-continuity regression — 1/1 passed.\\n- `tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json` — passed.\\n- Independent source review — ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`.\\n\\nA broader two-file diagnostic run before building generated CLI artifacts ended with 13 failures, including absent `cli/dist/index.js` and Rust-core daemon disconnections in unrelated durable-continuity fixtures. The targeted tests were rerun after a successful build; repository CI is required for the full exact-head result.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n`0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2` (`origin/main` at branch creation)\\n\",\"files\":[\"cli/src/agent.ts\",\"cli/src/types.ts\",\"cli/test/durable_continuity.test.ts\",\"cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts\"],\"reviews\":[],\"title\":\"fix: initialize mode-selected read-only posture\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":363710995}},"started_at_ms":1792980449509,"completed_at_ms":1792980449873}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:07:31.027Z","ordinal":369505,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a175f6-7ed3-7b02-8ceb-8270d544f432","call_id":"call_b70a179a4eab4298891a6bd214a5fd29","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Apply the effective read-only posture selected by the launch mode immediately to the bridge, authority admission engine, knowledge graph, and extension managers.\\n- Preserve mode-selected read-only as a deliberate, changeable mode while keeping explicit `--read-only` launches locked.\\n- Port the accepted session recovery regression into the current `durable_continuity.test.ts` suite, since the older test file was removed from current main.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `npm run build` — passed.\\n- `test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts` — 8/8 passed.\\n- Focused durable session-continuity regression — 1/1 passed.\\n- `tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json` — passed.\\n- Independent source review — ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`.\\n\\nA broader two-file diagnostic run before building generated CLI artifacts ended with 13 failures, including absent `cli/dist/index.js` and Rust-core daemon disconnections in unrelated durable-continuity fixtures. The targeted tests were rerun after a successful build; repository CI is required for the full exact-head result.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n`0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2` (`origin/main` at branch creation)\\n\",\"files\":[\"cli/src/agent.ts\",\"cli/src/types.ts\",\"cli/test/durable_continuity.test.ts\",\"cli/test/experimental_and_readonly.test.ts\"],\"reviews\":[],\"title\":\"fix: initialize mode-selected read-only posture\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a175f6-123b-7b40-b2ba-4195eb9a3260","create_time":1792980451.0273707}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
