{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:10:37.617Z","ordinal":369649,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a175f8-b5a1-7c50-af30-b3be06fb775c","turn_id":"01a175f8-b5a1-7c50-af30-b3be06fb775c","last_agent_message":"The current check is still running: PR #246’s Linux CLI suite is active on `a2aa9b1`; current `main`’s Linux CLI suite is active on `62e541c`. PR #246’s other required checks remain green, and its base-update preflight is conflict-free. Kimi retains the integration claim until CI finishes.\n\nThe previously stale T4 source claims are released and recorded. Held-out qualification still requires independent custodian acceptance; RC acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","started_at":1792980596,"completed_at":1792980637,"duration_ms":41480,"time_to_first_token_ms":1119}}
