{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:19:37.778Z","ordinal":369993,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17601-95b2-7821-b8fa-1ba1abaec9ae","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for exact HEAD `cf5ef34679bd7b2aa41b3f167b2749bd14ffff81` and diff SHA-256 `7ec79cfcf71e4dc578c163ebb5099fe83a28dd3df1a155b18a8268709244f6c9`.\n\nThe diff is limited to a 14-line insertion at the top of `READINESS.md`; the prior checkpoint is preserved unchanged, and acceptance remains explicitly `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\nThe 02:14 snapshot was accurate at that time, but PR #246’s status has since advanced: run `40255358554` is now **success**, including Linux packaging and reproducibility. Its log shows the reproducibility comparison began at 02:15:18 UTC. Please mark the 02:14 section as historical and add a newer status, or otherwise update the current checkpoint. Main CI `40255529634` remains in progress: Node 22/24 passed, and Linux is still running the CLI suite; requirements enforcement and packaging have not yet completed.\n\nOther checked claims align with the available records: main is `62e541c`; PR #246 is open at the stated head/base and the `agent.ts` claim belongs to Kimi; PR #243 merged as `0542312`; RC7’s archive digest matches the release; Issue #1 remains open with no later comment; and the text keeps held-out, terminal, provider, and release acceptance incomplete.\n\nOne wording note: the RC7 tag contains a PGP signature, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`). “Signed prerelease” is literally supported by the tag object; consider clarifying that this does not mean GitHub verified the signer.\n\nNo files were edited and no tests were run.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a175fc-3a2e-74f1-a3b4-8a558745a90a","create_time":1792981177.7781162}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18167}}
