{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:23:24.804Z","ordinal":370213,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a175fc-3a2e-74f1-a3b4-8a558745a90a","turn_id":"01a175fc-3a2e-74f1-a3b4-8a558745a90a","last_agent_message":"The `agent.ts` claim was already handed to Kimi at 01:54 UTC. Kimi owns the branch and worktree; PR #246’s checks passed on its old base.\n\nThe current `main` CI is still running its reproducible package check, so I haven’t touched Kimi’s branch. Once that run finishes, the next step is for Kimi to update the branch onto current `main` and rerun exact-head checks. The handoff is recorded, though I can’t confirm Kimi has seen it.","started_at":1792980826,"completed_at":1792981404,"duration_ms":578125,"time_to_first_token_ms":1709}}
