s; no E4 local gateway qualification evidence was available there. No stable `v1.0.0` release is published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`, and existing publication authorization remains granted but gated on the required acceptance evidence.\n+\n+The previous 02:19 checkpoint below is retained as historical evidence; this 02:24 checkpoint supersedes its integration-CI and PR #246 handoff status.\n+\n+## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:19 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; superseded by 02:24 update)\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1792981533665,"completed_at_ms":1792981533667}}
