ualification prerelease and does not include PR #243 or subsequent main changes. Held-out qualification, provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4, human terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. Stable v1.0.0 has not been published; publication authority remains granted but gated by acceptance.\\n+\\n+The 02:24 checkpoint below is retained as a historical snapshot and is superseded by this exact-head update.\\n+\\n+## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:24 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; superseded by 02:27 update)\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17605-0c8f-7f42-8d4b-980a6c519c84","create_time":1792981650.4207995}}}
