{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:30:33.916Z","ordinal":370563,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17605-0c8f-7f42-8d4b-980a6c519c84","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f2a067f5-7e92-4bfa-9e6c-2945bde504e7","process_id":"8332","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"5\\.3|terminal matrix|screenshots|80×24|40×14|200×60\" docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md docs/v1.0.0 -g '*.md' | head -80; rg --files docs/v1.0.0 | rg -i 'terminal|acceptance|readiness'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n \"5\\\\.3|terminal matrix|screenshots|80×24|40×14|200×60\" docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md docs/v1.0.0 -g '*.md'","query":"5\\.3|terminal matrix|screenshots|80×24|40×14|200×60","path":"ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"type":"list_files","cmd":"rg --files docs/v1.0.0","path":"v1.0.0"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -i 'terminal|acceptance|readiness'","query":"terminal|acceptance|readiness","path":null}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:50:| REQ-QUAL-108 | ACC-TUI-STEER, ACC-TUI-A11Y, ACC-TUI-MANUAL | CI PTY checks and installed-RC real-terminal matrix |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:80:| E3 | Operator dev box: Linux x86-64, real terminals (xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal) | Terminal matrix, live sessions |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:110:| ACC-TUI-A11Y | PTY with `NO_COLOR=1` and with `TERM=dumb` at 40×14 and 100×30 | Zero colour SGR codes. Every state is distinguishable by glyph and word. Hints are complete at 40 columns (TUI-10). |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:120:| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell passes; screenshots and per-cell verdicts are archived. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:182:| s2 approval under continuous typing, paste and burst, at 40×14 | No decision is made by stray input. A deliberate key decides. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:189:### 5.3 Manual real-terminal matrix (E3)\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:191:Terminals: xterm, kitty (kitty keyboard protocol on), tmux 3.x inside GNOME Terminal, VS Code integrated terminal, GNOME Terminal. Sizes: 80×24, 40×14, 200×60.\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:109:### 5.3 REPL approval\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:182:- **DEC-02** is resolved: the REPL stays a supported secondary surface, so §5.3 is required.\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:6:| Release class | **BLOCKER** for any v1 maturity claim: held-out matched evaluation, fault-injection qualification, standalone live qualification, scoring integrity. RELEASE-REQUIRED: T3 long tasks, a T4 smoke test in CI, a PTY terminal matrix. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:83:8. **REQ-QUAL-108. Terminal matrix.** PTY scripted runs in CI (existing `tui_*_e2e`, plus the new ACC-SAFE and ACC-PROC scripts). A manual matrix covers {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal} × {80x24, 40x14, 200x60}, checking: approval safety, paste, resize, cancel, narrow hints and NO_COLOR. Screenshots are archived.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:50:| REQ-QUAL-108 | ACC-TUI-STEER, ACC-TUI-A11Y, ACC-TUI-MANUAL | CI PTY checks and installed-RC real-terminal matrix |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:80:| E3 | Operator dev box: Linux x86-64, real terminals (xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal) | Terminal matrix, live sessions |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:110:| ACC-TUI-A11Y | PTY with `NO_COLOR=1` and with `TERM=dumb` at 40×14 and 100×30 | Zero colour SGR codes. Every state is distinguishable by glyph and word. Hints are complete at 40 columns (TUI-10). |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:120:| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell passes; screenshots and per-cell verdicts are archived. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:182:| s2 approval under continuous typing, paste and burst, at 40×14 | No decision is made by stray input. A deliberate key decides. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:189:### 5.3 Manual real-terminal matrix (E3)\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:191:Terminals: xterm, kitty (kitty keyboard protocol on), tmux 3.x inside GNOME Terminal, VS Code integrated terminal, GNOME Terminal. Sizes: 80×24, 40×14, 200×60.\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:110:| M5 | **Serial on `GATEWAY`.** The eval runner, the stripped-proxy runs and the independent reviewer's live task each take the `GATEWAY` claim. The terminal matrix (E3) and the install matrix (E2) can run in parallel with gateway runs. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md:190:| TUI-10 | S3 | RR | Narrow terminal | `live_view.rs` | RT (40×14) | Decision hint truncated | PLAN-01 task 13 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md:226:### 5.3 Completion truth, continuity and verification\ndocs/v1.0.0/ROADMAP.md:31:| **M5 Qualification** | PLAN-10 task 11 (T2 held-out 5×, T3, T4, standalone stripped-proxy profiles, provider verify); task 12 (terminal matrix); ACC-SUP-08 cross-runner reproducibility; independent acceptance (X5) of continuity and of the RC | Qualification evidence archive, scorer verdict table, independent reports | **G5**: ACCEPTANCE §4–§8 all PASS | 10–20 calendar days. About 84 h of serial inference for T2, plus T3/T4/standalone. Excludes fix loops. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/F_requirements_history.md:107:| docs/reviews/evidence/** (~180 files: casts, screenshots, logs, repro scripts) | excluded (raw evidence; not re-executed) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:36:| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3. Archive screenshots. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | RC build |\ndocs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md:241:| REQ-QUAL-108 | Audit | PTY CI plus a manual real-terminal matrix. | terminal acceptance | `cli/test/tui_*`; ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | TEST (PTY suites in CI); UNV (real terminals) | partial | ACCEPTANCE §5 | RR | D §6 | SPEC-10 / PLAN-10 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_terminal.md\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":27026}},"started_at_ms":1792981833915,"completed_at_ms":1792981833916}}
