doff. No local tests or additional suite execution started. Preserve current workflow evidence; resolve claim discrepancy before any new suite or post-merge workflow., checkpoint_fix_integrated=PR153 merged 2026-10-23T02:44:43Z; merge commit main 429bd3141b422ca38df19745d733588cc92901c4, includes independently accepted REPL prompt parity fix. Exact PR head 250dd96 CI39888390485 SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/CLI suite); CodeQL39888390479 SUCCESS; focused 4/4; requirements enforcement passed on base fa16045. Post-merge main CI39891244410 and CodeQL39891244389 active on exact merge commit. PR154 readiness documentation remains open at c033b38 on old base fa16045; old exact checks in Linux packaging stage, and refresh is needed after current main CI. No RC tag or release., pr154=Merged as 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Post-merge CodeQL 39891501527 SUCCESS, Node22/24 CI SUCCESS, Linux CI 39891501513 still in npm cli test at 2026-10-23 03:14 UTC. Coordination log latest confirms SUITE claim released after independent focused tests (5/5) on PR155 lane; do not start full local suite while hosted Linux test active. PR155 exact head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30 against main 382e018; independent ACCEPT; CodeQL pass; Node 22/24 checks running. Issue #1 remains open; latest comment remains metadata-only request 2026-10-22T22:08:34Z; no custodian response., doctor_d1b_candidate=Uncommitted change in isolated worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/doctor-integrity-scan, branch v1/doctor-integrity-scan, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. State scan now lstat batches capped at 128; regression test instruments 512 records and delays lstat 20ms to expose serial-timeout behavior. diff-check PASS. Tests queued until SUITE release; independent read-only review requested., current_ci=39891501513 on exact main 382e018 in_progress Node22/24 CLI test. 39891501527 CodeQL SUCCESS. Prior merge CI39891244410 on 429bd314 Node22/24 SUCCESS, linux setup acti