7501-c3b4-7891-a8cc-3d8239972bb2","order":17734,"revision":"retained_01a17501-c3b5-70c0-9bf0-50367fedf9dd","text":"I'm still getting the following error in rc.6:   ! INTERNAL: No checkpoint could be saved, so the turn did not start: Checkpoint could not verify protected Git state; no checkpoint was written\n\n","turn_id":"01a174c7-556b-7ee1-ba66-3871aa5dc679"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_01a17567-1abe-7f63-9a7d-055716818cf3","order":17901,"revision":"retained_01a17567-1abe-7f63-9a7d-057378679bf8","text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_86a4046e4bd344468bcad9804ef2dac0\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"I found a zero-byte `.git/index.lock` in `/home/mike/nexus-code`, timestamped about 20 hours ago. RC6’s generic checkpoint error is consistent with that lock. No Git process is visible in this shell, but I cannot confirm every agent/host namespace. How should I handle it? I’ll continue RC7 work either way.\",\"answer\":\"Remove after one final activity check\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n","turn_id":"01a17566-392e-7301-8215-10bb1045b974"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_01a17568-7052-7481-9852-29f3050d772d","order":17906,"revision":"retained_01a17568-7052-7481-9852-2a16be5e847c","text":"the kimi agent is waiting for agent.ts handover\n","turn_id":"01a17566-392e-7301-8215-10bb1045b974"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_01a17618-0539-7351-ae70-945a382b8b72","order":18210,"revision":"retained_01a17618-053a-75e2-bef2-eafe8b8ec52d","text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_effcf299ebf14d9cb708c722bd6ecc94\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"RC7 ChatGPT verification passed, but OpenRouter is disconnected. The v1.0.0 gate requires a pinned-model verification and one small live task. On `ubuntu-desktop`, run `nexus connect openrouter` and enter the key locally—please don’t paste it here—then tell me when it shows connected. If you cannot connect it, choose “OpenRouter unavailable” so I can record the dependency and continue other gates.\",\"answer\":\"I’ll connect it on Ubuntu now\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n","turn_id":"01a17605-0c8f-7f42-8d4b-980a6c519c84"}],"user_messages_incomplete":true,"verified_answers":[]},"window_id":"01a17618-8154-7ae3-bcce-b2bf4e874967","window_number":398}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:44:39.950Z","ordinal":370869,"type":"world_state","payload":{"full":true,"state":{"agents_md":{"directory":"/home/mike/nexus-code","text":"# Project Guidelines & Agent Instructions\n\n## Commands\n- Build: `make build` or `cargo build` or `npm run build`\n- Test: `make test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n"},"apps_instructions":false,"base_instructions":"cbcd6e6ca31b3667c3a6fb7fd063b0fec26e3174","collaboration_mode":{"mode":"default","model":"gpt-6-luna","instructions":"afcdf1ff905fb4e61ff4d6d89af089dbda3d5e4e"},"context_window_guidance":"","environments":{"environments":{"local":{"cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","status":"available","shell":"zsh"}},"current_date":"2026-10-26","timezone":"Etc/UTC","filesystem":"<filesystem><workspace_roots><root>/home/mike/nexus-code</root><root>/home/mike/.codex/visualizations/2026/10/18/01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92</root></workspace_roots><permission_profile type=\"disabled\"><file_system type=\"unrestricted\" /></permission_profile></f