{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:55:50.035Z","ordinal":371481,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17605-0c8f-7f42-8d4b-980a6c519c84","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adec1350fc881a0bddb00cb0b560452","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The upgrade process is still alive and its write counter has increased, so it is progressing through the backup. The delay is explained by RC6 syncing every copied file’s directory entry individually; I’m changing the next candidate to sync each directory once after its files are durable and to show safe aggregate progress, without changing the current run."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792983350032,"completed_at_ms":1792983350035}}
