{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:04:46.102Z","ordinal":371878,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17605-0c8f-7f42-8d4b-980a6c519c84","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adec34d4dd481a084c146795fdc589b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That error pinpoints the rollback: the backup completed, then RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed release-asset redirect host as a disallowed download origin. The launcher stayed on RC6. I’ll trace the installer’s URL policy and fix it so verified GitHub asset redirects are accepted without broadening downloads to arbitrary hosts."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792983885407,"completed_at_ms":1792983886102}}
