ils closed when a per-store marker survives without its global journal (3.021789ms)\n  ✔ fails closed on dangling active and per-store restore markers (2.863553ms)\n  ✔ refuses upgrade --check before loading config when restore is pending (1758.933973ms)\n  ✔ routes launches before legacy-client census and resumes after the legacy client exits (513.303196ms)\n  ✔ keeps a restore pending while a detached legacy client outlives its launcher (490.092288ms)\n✔ complete private state/config backup restore (4515.597472ms)\n▶ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_preserved (1714.702429ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_moved (1931.479261ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after provenance_written (1736.161754ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after launcher_switched (1910.850783ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after verifying_install (1962.377479ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after installed_wrong_version (2082.730056ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after kill_after_package_move (2256.665862ms)\n✔ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary (13597.044976ms)\n✔ rollback preserves permanent state guard inodes absent from an older snapshot (318.684354ms)\nℹ tests 47\nℹ suites 4\nℹ pass 47\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 37667.326367\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":38,"nanos":529423456}},"started_at_ms":1792983877586,"completed_at_ms":1792983916116}}
