{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:16:26.906Z","ordinal":372345,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17631-4fbf-7c42-94d2-9588e023f6c0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-36da75c7-5a9c-4d22-adb9-2acc00a75ea9","process_id":"3865","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,35p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; printf '%s\\n' '--- latest entries ---'; rg -n '^## ' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -10"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/upgrade-backup-progress","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,35p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","name":"READINESS.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n '^## ' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","query":"^## ","path":"READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 00:58 UTC at `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`)\n\n**Release state:** GitHub published signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7`; signed tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824` resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`. Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) succeeded. The published Linux archive SHA-256 is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`; `SHA256SUMS` SHA-256 is `7b8a5fd1d214919ae939275e59b76406d393fae31cdf4b184c33883b02dc64a9`. RC7 is an unaccepted prerelease; stable `v1.0.0` is not published.\n\n**Exact `main` source gates:** `origin/main` is `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`, merging PR #243's checkpoint index-lock diagnostic fix. Exact-main CI [40248550055](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550055) and CodeQL [40248550144](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550144) both passed on that SHA. A clean detached checkout with isolated HOME/XDG passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals. The PR #243 diff SHA-256 `fb6b7d5d81d66cb237799b4d7a41c3dfd59f931eeaa84e75117a38bf9fc97928` matched its independently accepted diff exactly. RC7 predates this merge and cannot qualify the updated source.\n\n**RC7 artifact evidence:** The tag's release workflow produced the public assets and attestations. `gh attestation verify` passed for both the archive and `SHA256SUMS` under the exact repository, workflow, tag, and source constraints; the checksum-index attestation is [59728626](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/attestations/59728626). Cross-runner workflow [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777) passed on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Both manifests validated, and the archive, checksum manifest, notices, compatibility file, installer, and CycloneDX SBOM matched byte-for-byte across the two runner outputs and the public release. An isolated install reports `1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f)`. These are artifact and installation checks, not product qualification.\n\n**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest comment is coordinator-authored at 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC, with no independent custodian acceptance or evaluator-compatible held-out corpus disposition. Held-out T2 has not started, and no private payload was accessed. Provider/standalone qualification and T3/T4 evidence remain incomplete. The five-environment by three-size manual terminal matrix remains 0/15, with no per-cell verdicts or required screenshots. The `cli/src/agent.ts` remediation handoff remains with KimiCode-defect-scan; implementation is still pending in that claimed lane.\n\n**Disposition:** Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; RC7 is not accepted and no stable release is claimed. The next release candidate must include the merged checkpoint fix, pass exact-source CI and qualification gates, and be installed and identified before product qualification. Remaining gates include independent held-out custody and T2, provider/standalone behavior, T3/T4, all 15 human terminal cells, and independent exact-RC acceptance. Publication authorization remains granted once every required gate passes.\n\n## Superseded release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n\n## Earlier release checkpoint (superseded; observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n\n**Release state:** GitHub lists `v1.0.0-rc.6` as the latest published prerelease. Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` (tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824`) now points to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) is in progress. GitHub has not published an RC7 release or assets yet. RC6 is not an accepted RC, and no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n\n**Exact `main` source gates:** Current `origin/main` is `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`. Post-merge CodeQL run [40243331241](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331241) passed on this exact SHA. Post-merge CI run [40243331324](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331324) completed successfully on this exact SHA: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility, SBOM, smoke, and installer checks passed. At this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in a detached worktree with isolated HOME/XDG: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source gates do not constitute installed-RC acceptance.\n\n**Candidate changes:** PR #241 merged source/version preparation at `431cb194`, and signed RC7 tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` points to that exact source. PR #243 is refreshed onto exact base `431cb194` at head `a563eee0206d1287f5375a0ae113b1ca392fffd1`. Its CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; its exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 matrix jobs are running in CI run [40244800085](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40244800085). Independent source review accepted the exact candidate diff. PR #244 updates only this readiness document at head `0618fbc9d123043506f76eacf9753892cdd06963`; its CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 checks passed, while Linux packaging is running in [40243816407](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243816407). PR #245 updates four manifests/lockfiles for the completed Cloudflare experiment at head `13a955dbe156daec996fd97cfe6946024a3f0b48`; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 passed, and Linux packaging is running in [40244355480](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40244355480). An independent source review accepted PR #245's exact diff. No PR has been merged on the strength of checks from another commit.\n\n**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; the latest status has no independent custodian acceptance or evaluator-compatible corpus disposition. No held-out qualification is evidenced. The Ubuntu/GNOME terminal host is now connected and its five requested terminal applications were found in a setup-only preflight; the worksheet still has all 15 cells blank, no exact RC is installed there, and no screenshot evidence exists. The five-environment by three-size manual matrix still requires genuine operator evidence. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; independent exact-RC acceptance and stable-release gates are incomplete.\n\n**Next evidence:** Finish the RC7 Release workflow and verify its exact artifact identity and provenance. Finish exact-head CI for PRs #243–245, integrate only after required review and checks, and requalify resulting main before constructing a subsequent candidate. The `cli/src/agent.ts` defect-remediation handoff is recorded for KimiCode-defect-scan; its implementation is not yet present in that branch. Resolve independent held-out custody and evaluator compatibility before beginning protected qualification; then qualify an eligible installed RC and complete the manual terminal matrix. Keep source gates, RC construction, installed-RC qualification, and stable-release checks distinct.\n\n## Current release convergence status (observed 2026-10-23 13:35 UTC at `1f3c655`)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `1f3c655971ade086f55347926db16cf2ecd52d1f`, merging PR #161's pinned Linux builder/reproducibility changes. Exact-main CI [39957281380](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39957281380) completed successfully: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 jobs all passed, including the full CLI suite, security gates, requirements check, reproducible package builds, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke. Exact-main CodeQL [39957281390](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39957281390) also passed. On a clean detached checkout of this exact SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports all components at `1.0.0-rc.3`. These are source-gate results; the CI package is validation output, not a new published RC.\n\n**Distribution scope:** The release owner confirmed the supported distribution target is the GitHub installer/archive only; npm publication is inapplicable. The current release workflow is the authority for published assets.\n\n**RC3, checkpoint choice, and Doctor:** RC3 remains the latest published prerelease, tagged at `1b9791f07d301c885fe48f04a796203583ab5a5c`; its archive digest and provenance are recorded in the snapshot below. The operator's `Sensitive content prevents durable persistence to checkpoint` failure occurred on immutable RC1, which predates the interactive choice flow. RC3 source contains the five choices: read-only, continue in the configured mode without a rollback checkpoint, create a checkpoint with the sensitivity risk acknowledged, cancel, or re-enter the instruction. Current RC3 source also scans saved-state metadata asynchronously in bounded batches, accepts schema-2 task `messageLog` records, and treats a configured model absent from `/models` as unverified rather than unavailable; a `--deep` inference probe can verify it. The interrupted-write temporary file reported by Doctor is a separate real warning and is not automatically repaired. These source checks and existing tests do not substitute for exercising the exact installed candidate on the operator's own state.\n--- latest entries ---\n3:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 00:58 UTC at `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`)\n15:## Superseded release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n17:## Earlier release checkpoint (superseded; observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n29:## Current release convergence status (observed 2026-10-23 13:35 UTC at `1f3c655`)\n43:## Current RC3 artifact and installed-candidate status (observed 2026-10-23 09:11 UTC at `1b9791f`; point-in-time snapshot)\n55:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 08:14 UTC at `1b9791f`; superseded above)\n67:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 04:11 UTC at `1a484c3`; superseded above)\n83:## Historical integration checkpoint (observed 2026-10-23 02:13 UTC at `fa16045`; superseded by the current status above)\n97:## Historical integration update (2026-10-22 21:14 UTC; superseded by the current status above)\n107:## Integration update (2026-10-22 11:50 UTC)\n","