des that diverge from extraction accounting (8.55846ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with escaping symlink (6.934595ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive containing disallowed entry types (FIFOs, devices, hardlinks) (5.278687ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive with duplicate entries (12.710322ms)\n  ✔ safely extracts valid archive and validates containment walk (24.07649ms)\n✔ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (119.380378ms)\n▶ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09)\n  ✔ creates protected config and state backups with 0600 file and 0700 dir permissions (125.026743ms)\n  ✔ restores configuration cleanly from backup with strict 0600 permissions (207.69124ms)\n✔ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09) (333.240615ms)\n▶ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07)\n  ✔ validates and generates valid compatibility metadata (2.629759ms)\n  ✔ package validator rejects unsupported compatibility schemas (98.939349ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed compatibility metadata (0.564016ms)\n  ✔ refuses downgrade when target release state schema is older than current state schema (1.025905ms)\n  ✔ enforces minimum supported config and state schema versions (0.823519ms)\n  ✔ compares minimum updater versions using full SemVer prerelease ordering (0.609667ms)\n  ✔ rejects a target config schema older than the current config schema (0.410244ms)\n  ✔ applies legacy policy for releases lacking compatibility metadata (0.377586ms)\n✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (106.36295ms)\n▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n  ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (1104.711185ms)\n  ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (24.321994ms)\n✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (1129.423079ms)\n▶ Upgrade Journal, Cr