{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:21:00.199Z","ordinal":372506,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17639-c627-7830-832b-0568641099e6","call_id":"call_144e97e9eb56462c81f3d95f920560f4","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"874e49\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.001478435,\"session_id\":99651,\"original_token_count\":1005,\"output\":\"isolated_home=/tmp/nexus-upgrade-validation.6cuSru\\n▶ managed client invocation classification\\n  ✔ keeps ambiguous maintenance options on the normal client path (1.976808ms)\\n  ✔ releases the normal client lease only for recognized metadata and restore commands (0.43358ms)\\n✔ managed client invocation classification (4.728401ms)\\n▶ durable same-version transaction recovery\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash before-old-move (851.865018ms)\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-old-move (1331.438159ms)\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-new-move (1403.266493ms)\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-provenance (1390.06594ms)\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-link (1317.839217ms)\\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-failed-displacement (1303.31005ms)\\n  ✔ retains backups and truthful journal when restoring the link fails (832.111402ms)\\n  ✔ admits only one recovery when two contenders both observe the same stale lock (1584.288974ms)\\n  ✔ reclaims a stale lock through the kernel guard without contention (539.171717ms)\\n  ✔ reports the guard path and stays back while a live reclaimer holds the kernel guard (465.615824ms)\\n  ✔ acquires the kernel guard after its holder is killed (770.251658ms)\\n  ✔ does not leak descriptors across repeated guard contention (240.222314ms)\\n  ✔ fails closed when the flock utility is unavailable (8.502379ms)\\n  ✔ rejects a symlinked reclaim guard (3.506095ms)\\n  ✔ rejects a FIFO reclaim guard (9.069384ms)\\n  ✔ rejects a reclaim guard with unsafe permissions (3.32778ms)\\n  ✔ does not touch the lock for a completed journal in a read-only package directory (1793.220681ms)\\n  ✔ does not finalize a launcher that reports the wrong release (1136.365761ms)\\n  ✔ refuses missing runtime components despite a successful version shim (47.983879ms)\\n  ✔ uses the actual previous same-version package for explicit binary rollback (824.798829ms)\\n  ✔ rejects a redirected backup without touching outside data (37.186621ms)\\n  ✔ check-only leaves a pending transaction byte-for-byte unchanged (1958.304083ms)\\n  ✔ explicit recovery rejects invalid journals with an operational exit (1846.228789ms)\\n  ✔ bounds hung probes and kills their process group (276.799161ms)\\n✔ durable same-version transaction recovery (19978.737372ms)\\n▶ complete private state/config backup restore\\n  ✔ reports byte progress while a single large file is still being copied (129.351489ms)\\n  ✔ reports only aggregate backup progress and syncs each copied directory once (394.132071ms)\\n  ✔ restores session payloads and config rather than copying an archive into config.env (790.588854ms)\\n  ✔ flushes every automatic backup payload and containing directory before returning (186.940696ms)\\n  ✔ preserves an existing backup when exclusive creation reports EEXIST (9.167312ms)\\n  ✔ does not merge into an existing timestamped state backup directory (12.070008ms)\\n  ✔ keeps committed restore barriers until staged payload cleanup succeeds (184.488684ms)\\n  ✔ replays a prepared restore after interruption and blocks state access until recovery (203.187621ms)\\n  ✔ fails closed when a per-store marker survives without its global journal (3.695639ms)\\n  ✔ fails closed on dangling active and per-store restore markers (2.903677ms)\\n  ✔ refuses upgrade --check before loading config when restore is pending (1802.079683ms)\\n  ✔ routes launches before legacy-client census and resumes after the legacy client exits (542.193618ms)\\n  ✔ keeps a restore pending while a detached legacy client outlives its launcher (550.463724ms)\\n✔ complete private state/config backup restore (4813.455199ms)\\n▶ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary\\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_preserved (1822.383023ms)\\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_moved (1764.882846ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17631-4fbf-7c42-94d2-9588e023f6c0","create_time":1792984860.1990194}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
