ater entries (6.836666ms)\n  ✔ rejects local and global PAX size overrides that diverge from extraction accounting (9.705355ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with escaping symlink (6.509132ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive containing disallowed entry types (FIFOs, devices, hardlinks) (5.695376ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive with duplicate entries (5.914707ms)\n  ✔ safely extracts valid archive and validates containment walk (20.056189ms)\n✔ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (114.584316ms)\n▶ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09)\n  ✔ creates protected config and state backups with 0600 file and 0700 dir permissions (150.367235ms)\n  ✔ restores configuration cleanly from backup with strict 0600 permissions (207.063242ms)\n✔ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09) (358.134358ms)\n▶ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07)\n  ✔ validates and generates valid compatibility metadata (3.976562ms)\n  ✔ package validator rejects unsupported compatibility schemas (89.233006ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed compatibility metadata (0.819619ms)\n  ✔ refuses downgrade when target release state schema is older than current state schema (1.679398ms)\n  ✔ enforces minimum supported config and state schema versions (1.453103ms)\n  ✔ compares minimum updater versions using full SemVer prerelease ordering (1.324441ms)\n  ✔ rejects a target config schema older than the current config schema (0.96864ms)\n  ✔ applies legacy policy for releases lacking compatibility metadata (0.882213ms)\n✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (102.186429ms)\n▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n  ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (712.598815ms)\n  ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (18.841765ms)\n✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (732.097904ms)\n▶ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12)\n  ✔ recovers an interrupted upgrade that crashed during downloading or staging (453.734919ms)\n  ✔ fails closed without deleting paths named by a malicious journal (31.079281ms)\n  ✔ rejects a staging path whose apparent parent is redirected by a symlink (30.44045ms)\n  ✔ accepts backup paths under HOME with a custom installation prefix (16.613301ms)\n  ✔ never executes a target binary redirected outside its version directory (872.149155ms)\n  ✔ does not repoint the launcher to an external source symlink during early recovery (52.32524ms)\n  ✔ rolls back when a contained target launcher exits unsuccessfully (820.056103ms)\n  ✔ recovers a crash during switching by reverting symlink to source installation (554.370182ms)\n  ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (444.904538ms)\n  ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (2.234719ms)\n✔ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12) (3279.713185ms)\nℹ tests 35\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 35\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 5886.909731\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":6,"nanos":821351400}},"started_at_ms":1792987576033,"completed_at_ms":1792987582855}}
