itching by reverting symlink to source installation (554.370182ms)\n  ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (444.904538ms)\n  ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (2.234719ms)\n✔ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12) (3279.713185ms)\nℹ tests 35\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 35\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 5886.909731\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17631-4fbf-7c42-94d2-9588e023f6c0","create_time":1792987583.9932823}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
