{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T04:17:53.238Z","ordinal":374071,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016aded46db2f881a0b9e29b75f80c06ed","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7833eae7947e4108a1f56b4af51fa30f","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-upgrade-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\nFix the RC6-to-RC7 upgrade failure caused by GitHub redirecting the canonical release URL to a short-lived signed asset URL. The installer now accepts only HTTPS redirects to the exact `release-assets.githubusercontent.com/github-production-release-asset/` path, keeps manual redirect validation, and does not forward GitHub credentials to the asset host. Error diagnostics report only the origin, never signed query parameters.\\n\\nPre-migration backups now report bounded aggregate progress and sync directory entries once per copied directory while retaining per-file fsync and fail-closed backup handling. This makes large backups observable and reduces repeated directory sync overhead.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `upgrade_safety.test.ts`: 35/35 passed, including the canonical GitHub-to-signed-asset redirect, credential isolation, and successful payload write.\\n- `upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts`: 47/47 passed.\\n- TypeScript typecheck and CLI build passed; generated `cli/dist` remained clean.\\n- Requirements enforcement and version synchronization passed on the clean candidate tree.\\n- Independent source and test review: ACCEPT.\\n\\nExact-head CI is required before integration. This change does not establish RC acceptance; the correctly versioned next RC must be built and qualified after integration.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-upgrade-backup-progress --title \\\"fix: accept signed GitHub release asset redirects\\\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-upgrade-pr-body.md\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":400}); text(JSON.stringify(r));","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17631-4fbf-7c42-94d2-9588e023f6c0","create_time":1792988269.7012122}}}
