{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T06:09:55.537Z","ordinal":375547,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17631-4fbf-7c42-94d2-9588e023f6c0","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-d495472b-4744-4435-b4fd-e4a15c4dbbef","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Post-merge main CI/CodeQL on e61255e active. Took over explicitly handed-off DEFECT_RECOVER_WORKTREE_CONVERSATION_20261026 on existing clean worktree and rebased onto e61255e at 180fe0c34be7390d8cfb5f9e02e8c79262f8c182; 3/3 patches identical, diff-check passes, independent review pending. Local SUITE claim by KimiCode-defect-scan is live on provider-stream-suite-b5b28b6; wait for release before running any tests., current_main=origin/main@8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f; post-merge CI and CodeQL pending., sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298 all four jobs SUCCESS and CodeQL39689926282 SUCCESS, but it is based on old main 049880f; main moved to f8ba4c after PR126. Refresh readiness claim to current main after postmerge CI39692357597/CodeQL39692357575 terminal and rerun exact-head checks., main_postmerge_CI=Run40243331324 exact main431cb194: Node22 and Node24 full test matrices SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 remains active at Node runtime install after earlier build/requirements/cargo gates., main_postmerge_CodeQL=Run 40171717805 exact main 05994a4 SUCCESS., PR127=open; refreshed exact head f9d2743decd2dd3a4816f3bd8b5ec7f00d7a8801 based on ac8a97; normal push from remote head 0d87c00; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39706694418 and 39706694528 running, CodeQL39706694522 SUCCESS; SUITE exclusive claim held, contest_freeze=none; user confirms contest has ended, release_status=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; RC6 immutable/latest known installed prerelease; RC7 and stable v1.0.0 not accepted or released., current_main_CI=SUCCESS exact origin/main@431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1: CI40243331324 Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 all completed successfully; CodeQL40243331241 SUCCESS. Requirements --enforce was recorded PASS on this exact source: 123 rows, 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals., REDACTED SUCCESS exact main, release_blocker=exact-main behavioral CI failures on Node22 and Node24; awaiting workflow logs after terminal to identify cases and classify, PR128=candidate 8e114e2 based on 7952fac; independent review ACCEPT; no push/tests until main failure is triaged and exact main source suite passes, pr139=MERGED; exact PR CI39721786589 and CodeQL39721786428 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge CI39725081299 and CodeQL39725081349 in progress, runtime_policy_conflict=Awaiting user choice: merged DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure vs later relayed no-EOL-runtime mandate and draft PR13