ost-merge CI run `39144374445` is still running Node 20/22/24; its Cloudflare contract job passed. Exact integration CI on the parent `faf9580` passed as run `39139084949`, but it does not replace checks on `4bce876`.\n- **PR state:** PRs #9, #13, #15, #16, and #44 are integrated. PR #9's stale readiness changes were merged earlier and are retained in history. PR #33 remains open at `0ca77e5ee64f80db02e2b16178c5be551ce5de0c`, based on now-stale `faf9580`; its exact CI run `39141771002` passed all five jobs, including 1,243 CLI tests with zero failures, resource enforcement fixtures, staged Git-history/external-store canaries, security gates, deterministic package/SBOM comparison, and installer/package smoke. Independent review found a release-critical gap: preflight does not compare protected corpus paths with the evaluator's unconditional system mounts such as `/usr/local/lib`. The reviewer requested refusal of protected paths beneath every mounted host path and regression coverage. The evaluator claim remains active; no transfer or remediation checkpoint has been reported. Do not run held-out qualification. PR #33 must incorporate `4bce876`, fix this finding, pass exact-head checks, and receive independent re-review.\n- **Requirements enforcement:** `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` ran from a detached worktree at exact revision `4bce8760893b222789b76011a477dd61988ecba6` with isolated `HOME`; it failed as required. Ledger result: 123 rows (109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 11 below threshold: `REQ-AGT-002`, `REQ-AGT-010`, `REQ-PRV-003`, `REQ-REL-005`, `REQ-AGT-110`, `REQ-PRV-111`, `REQ-REL-114`, `REQ-QUAL-101`, `REQ-QUAL-107`, `REQ-QUAL-108`, `REQ-QUAL-109`. `REQ-AGT-118` remains tested. `REQ-AGT-010` remains partial; its existing ACC-TRUST-04 source evidence is pinned to `2c70d39`, and the current row still needs exact-revision evidence and a DEC-04-aligned disposition before promotion. The ledger owner was given this exact checker