\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361213\",\"contentType\":\"application/json\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:1263ba7194d2440f897e1ec3e05a63ecb59976f0c8993189dedfee8f9b19792b\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7Y9\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"sbom.cdx.json\",\"size\":163389,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/sbom.cdx.json\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361211\",\"contentType\":\"application/octet-stream\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:ecdc6ae117d8a10bfc3f3945bb2aa126c0793be37384d9b82389c4e27dcd36f4\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7Y7\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"sbom.cdx.json.sha256\",\"size\":80,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/sbom.cdx.json.sha256\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361214\",\"contentType\":\"application/json\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:1263ba7194d2440f897e1ec3e05a63ecb59976f0c8993189dedfee8f9b19792b\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7Y-\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"sbom.json\",\"size\":163389,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/sbom.json\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361206\",\"contentType\":\"application/octet-stream\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:18622df71f79f69c6ef58bb042470008df088eebbc373fe30a0ed82f7b487d0c\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7Y2\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"sbom.json.sha256\",\"size\":76,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/sbom.json.sha256\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361215\",\"contentType\":\"application/octet-stream\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:a66f6ca27ada41593370d253b0f55e9a8aacba2968875806f00676c6ffa1daff\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7Y_\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"SHA256SUMS\",\"size\":189,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/SHA256SUMS\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/677361216\",\"contentType\":\"text/plain\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:9877e2f2866a93e38095332a69c34c4342c0317c66242b8c1db1219202dfc8d6\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oX7ZA\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\",\"size\":242795,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:23Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.8/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\"}],\"body\":\"# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.8 release candidate\\n\\n**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\\n\\n**Status:** this candidate is for exact-artifact qualification. It does not establish independent acceptance or authorize stable v1.0.0 promotion. Qualification results must identify the workflow-produced package and its digest.\\n\\nThis release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`.\\n\\n## Changes since RC7\\n\\n- **Checkpoint safety:** checkpoint creation now detects a present or unreadable Git index lock before publishing a checkpoint reference, and reports why it stopped. It rechecks the lock after validation and stash creation so a concurrent Git operation is less likely to publish a stale checkpoint.\\n- **Read-only mode consistency:** the effective permission posture is applied consistently when an agent and its workspace extensions start or change modes. A temporary checkpoint-safety fallback stays separate from the configured mode, allowing recovery without silently changing the operator's selected mode.\\n- **Recovered operation continuity:** recovered operation context is retained across session restoration, while prior verifier baselines remain untrusted and require fresh verification before a recovered result can be treated as verified.\\n- **Upgrade reliability:** GitHub release downloads now follow its signed release-asset redirect without forwarding GitHub credentials to the asset host. Large pre-migration backups report aggregate progress and avoid redundant directory syncs while retaining file and directory durability.\\n\\n## Runtime requirements\\n\\n- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\\n- Node.js 22 or newer.\\n- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\\n\\nThe archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\\n\\n## Candidate assets\\n\\nThe release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.8` is expected to produce the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance. The workflow run, tag commit, artifact digests, and qualification evidence must be recorded before this candidate can be accepted. Local builds are not interchangeable with the workflow-produced artifacts.\\n\",\"isPrerelease\":true,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-26T07:26:22Z\",\"tagName\":\"v1.0.0-rc.8\",\"targetCommitish\":\"main\"}\n{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"headSha\":\"bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752\",\"jobs\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"package\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40283394697\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_