{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:33:25.350Z","ordinal":376873,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a176ed-37ea-76a2-9958-cddd74a6f333","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-d3e96b11-50fa-44b8-a30e-3a5dd554c4dc","process_id":"13376","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'OpenRouter|pinned model|model fingerprint|openrouter' /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/reviews/evidence -g '*.md' | head -80"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'OpenRouter|pinned model|model fingerprint|openrouter' /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md /tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/reviews/evidence -g '*.md'","query":"OpenRouter|pinned model|model fingerprint|openrouter","path":"DECISIONS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:14:| [DEC-06](#dec-06-supported-providers-for-v1) | Supported providers | Local OpenAI-compatible + OpenRouter supported; others experimental until live-verified | No |\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:112:**Inference environment.** All runs go through the homelab-ai gateway, which is the only inference path (owner, 2026-10-14). There is no direct worker access and no extra GPU. Every run, Nexus and peers alike, is serial on one gateway-backed model. Wall time is the critical-path cost (PLAN-10). Live cloud connections (ChatGPT sign-in, OpenRouter) may be used for small-spend checks, but are not used for matched comparisons. One reason: `openrouter/free` routed 3 requests to 3 different models in the 2026-10-14 verify run, which breaks model matching.\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:122:| **Supported** | OpenRouter | Live-verified 2026-10-14 at db1ca55 (`evidence/live/verify_openrouter.json`); re-verify at RC with a **pinned** model (not `openrouter/free`). |\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:248:| X4 | **Partly resolved 2026-10-14:** the existing ChatGPT sign-in and OpenRouter connections are authorized for small-spend checks; both were live-verified at db1ca55. Optional: add OpenAI API-key or Anthropic keys if those providers should be listed as supported. | DEC-06 | M5 (optional) |\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:37:**Qualification evidence and blockers:** The RC3 provider record `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.3/providers/e5-provider-verification-20261023.json` was independently accepted: ChatGPT sign-in streaming/tool round trip passed; OpenRouter failed authentication and its live task remains outstanding. Public Issue #1 remains open; its latest visible update is coordinator-authored at 10:23 UTC, with no custodian response. The sealed legacy `hidden.command` corpus is not accepted by the current `blackbox-v1` runner; no held-out qualification has started and no private payload was accessed. T2/T3/T4, long-task and fault-injection qualification, exact-candidate cross-runner reproducibility, all 15 human terminal cells, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete.\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:291:| `REQ-PRV-111` | partial | RC-pinned live provider verification is incomplete. Historical OpenRouter/ChatGPT evidence is not RC evidence; OpenRouter must use a pinned model. OpenAI API-key and Anthropic paths have no configured authorization. | Installed RC; available provider authorization | Provider qualification operator | On the RC, run `providers verify` for OpenRouter with a pinned model and complete one live small §6-style bug-fix task with a correct outcome. Repeat ChatGPT sign-in verification and retain PASS on the RC; keep ChatGPT, OpenAI API-key, and Anthropic experimental unless separately verified. |\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:342:- On the exact installed RC5 package, OpenRouter pinned model `nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free` and ChatGPT sign-in model `gpt-6-luna` each passed streamed completion and tool-call/result verification. No workspace content was involved. OpenRouter's required live small engineering task remains pending; the disposable synthetic task has a failing baseline and waits for the operator's folder-trust choice. Nexus remains in its default `review` approval mode; folder trust does not change approvals.\n/tmp/nexus-v1-main-bbafae/docs/reviews/evidence/qualification_2026-10-12/peers.md:20:| **5. Inference compatibility** | Built-in providers `openai`, `ollama`, `lmstudio`; `--oss` with `oss_provider = lmstudio|ollama`; custom `model_providers.<id>.base_url`; `wire_api` only `responses` (Responses API required); `request_max_retries` 4, `stream_max_retries` 5, `stream_idle_timeout_ms` 300000 [CX-CFG]. | Anthropic API, Bedrock, Google Agent Platform (Vertex), Microsoft Foundry, LLM gateways exposing a supported (Anthropic-format) API; Anthropic \"doesn't support routing Claude Code to non-Claude models through any gateway\" [CC-GW]. Cost/token metrics via OTel; `-p --output-format json` returns usage and cost [CC-OTEL][CC-SESS]. | \"75+\" providers; Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp (llama-server) via `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible` + `options.baseURL`; `@ai-sdk/openai` for `/v1/responses`; per-model context/output limits [OC-PROV]. | ~60 providers; Ollama (warns 4096 default ctx, `OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH`), LM Studio, Docker Model Runner (llama.cpp path), Ramalama (`--jinja` required), vLLM via `OPENAI_HOST`, custom providers in OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama formats; \"models without [tool calling] can only do chat completion\" [GS-PROV]. | OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Groq, LM Studio, xAI, Azure, Cohere, DeepSeek, Ollama, OpenAI-compatible, OpenRouter, Copilot, Vertex, Bedrock; text edit formats (no native tool calls needed); warns weaker models may fail to produce applicable edits [AI-LLMS][AI-EDIT]. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":44249}},"started_at_ms":1793000005350,"completed_at_ms":1793000005350}}
