 mikeholownych/v1/defect-recover-worktree…\",\"headSha\":\"8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40277021174\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T05:57:05Z\",\"databaseId\":40277020977,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #249 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-recover-worktree…\",\"headSha\":\"8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40277020977\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:59:58Z\",\"databaseId\":40271906420,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #248 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-upgrade-backup-p…\",\"headSha\":\"a7880b64c98d5f3f6522a18a97b2a10489f9461e\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40271906420\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:59:58Z\",\"databaseId\":40271906530,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #248 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-upgrade-backup-p…\",\"headSha\":\"a7880b64c98d5f3f6522a18a97b2a10489f9461e\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40271906530\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:23:37Z\",\"databaseId\":40268837923,\"displayTitle\":\"npm_and_yarn in /cli for typescript - Update #1653021379\",\"headSha\":\"e61255ec6b3ae0a1ed007ce6e53132324e2e80e9\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40268837923\",\"workflowName\":\"Dependabot Updates\"}]\n\nWORKSTATE\n{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Continue exact-RC acceptance against RC8; do not interpret install/version as overall doctor or product acceptance. Local SUITE claim for KimiCode-defect-scan remains <24h and owner/pid not live on this host; preserve claim and avoid running suites or test files. Need custodian acceptance, provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, terminal matrix and independent/human acceptance., current_main=origin/main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752; requirements --enforce PASS 123 rows (108 tested/6 partial/2 implemented/7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals); sync-version PASS rc.8; CodeQL 40279197561 SUCCESS; exact-main CI 40279197785 COMPLETED SUCCESS, Node22/24, Linux suite/package/repro/SBOM/install checks complete., sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298 all four jobs SUCCESS and CodeQL39689926282 SUCCESS, but it is based on old main 049880f; main moved to f8ba4c after PR126. Refresh readiness claim to current main after postmerge CI39692357597/CodeQL39692357575 terminal and rerun exact-head checks., main_postmerge_CI=Run40243331324 exact main431cb194: Node22 and Node24 full test matrices SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 remains active at Node runtime install after earlier build/requirements/cargo gates., main_postmerge_CodeQL=Run 40171717805 exact main 05994a4 SUCCESS., PR127=open; refreshed exact head f9d2743decd2dd3a4816f3bd8b5ec7f00d7a8801 based on ac8a97; normal push from remote head 0d87c00; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39706694418 and 39706694528 running, CodeQL39706694522 SUCCESS; SUITE exclusive claim held, contest_freeze=none; user confirms contest has ended, release_status=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; RC6 immutable/latest known installed prerelease; RC7 and stable v1.0.0 not accepted or released., current_main_CI=SUCCESS exact origin/main@431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1: CI40243331324 Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 all completed successfully; CodeQL40243331241 SUCCESS. Requirements --enforce was recorded PASS on this exact source: 123 rows, 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals., REDACTED SUCCESS exact main, release_blocker=exact-main behavioral CI failures on Node22 and Node24; awaiting workflow logs after terminal to identify cases and classify, PR128=candidate 8e114e2 based on 7952fac; independent review ACCEPT; no push/tests until main failure is triaged and exact main source suite passes, pr139=MERGED; exact PR CI39721786589 and CodeQL39721786428 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge CI39725081299 and CodeQL39725081349 in progress, runtime_policy_conflict=Awaiting user choice: merged DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure vs later relayed no-EOL-runtime mandate and draft PR137 >=22; do not alter runtime floor until resolved, pr128_head=8b585b5aa0223dcd2cd8f2bd90cb27c858dd66d3 pushed normal fast-forward after main CI; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39728018027 running Node20/22/24; CodeQL39728018086 SUCCESS, suite_claim=KimiCode-defect-scan claims SUITE for focused validation on v1/defect-provider-client-blockers; safe-boundary status request appended 09:18Z; no takeover or overlapping local tests., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; RC7 remains unaccepted; stable v1.0.0 not published., pr128=merged at ae54328; exact CI and CodeQL passed, pr125=merged at 8935918; exact candidate e4c91d7 review accepted; all six checks passed; prior lockfile finding fixed, post_merge_main=Exact main05994a4 CI40171717813 remains in Node22/24 npm CLI suites; CodeQL40171717805 SUCCESS., runtime_policy=Node >=20 vs >=22 decision remains pending direct user choice; official Node Release WG schedule confirms Node 20 EOL 2026-04-30. Affected README/DEVELOPMENT/quickstart files still claimed by Claude node22-floor; no edits without handoff., heldout_public_manifest=origin/main 8935918455a7fcc9434762712528c1169ec4ff63: eval/heldout-manifest.json SHA-256 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b; public metadata declares 40 tasks, 10 each across bugfix/debug/feature/refactor and Go/JavaScript/Python/Rust; PR16 merged f7769031cd8c2ccf281b5e930348889e9be7fa66; no custody acceptance inferred, no private payload read, main_CI=Run 40171717813: Node24 SUCCESS, Node22 CLI test IN_PROGRESS; CodeQL 40171717805 SUCCESS, host_preflight=PR140 merged at 44ca13d after Node20/22/24, Linux package/repro, CodeQL and independent ACCEPT; PR141 is sequential repeat capture with accepted review, but exact CI was cancelled and its branch must rebase/rerun after main postmerge checks., pr140_ci=39743451782 CodeQL terminal SUCCESS on a439b78. CI 39743451659 remains in_progress on a439b78; all jobs completed build/version/requirements/cargo tests. Node20/22/24 currently running npm CLI test stage; no conclusions yet. Exact head remains based on current main 8935918. No merge until CI terminal., resource_fixture_trace=Current exact source cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts includes qualification preflight assertions and production spawnConta"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","create_time":1793000607.2943637}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
