{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:45:24.034Z","ordinal":377428,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0513112c81a0b40cd553abb840a0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The next concrete blocker is in RC8’s live-task verifier flow: the harness runs a discovered verifier before editing, but a successful mutating shell command can mark the workspace as changed before a pre-change verifier baseline is captured. I’ve confirmed the single-suite claim is actively running, so I won’t overlap its tests; I’m taking an isolated source/test slice and will hold execution until that suite releases."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793000723424,"completed_at_ms":1793000724034}}
