{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:48:00.863Z","ordinal":377528,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-9ef6e1cd-79fe-4b27-b8e0-960c09c74ae9","process_id":"99008","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code --json state,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,updatedAt,comments:(.comments[-4:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}))}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code --json state,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,updatedAt,comments:(.comments[-4:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}))}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody status request: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent c\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qualification has been established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15, T4 has not run, and the reproducibility workflow has not run on an RC. The metadata-only custody request from 2026-10-24 02:16 UTC remains unanswered.\\n\\nPlease reply\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:55:09Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task o\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Public metadata-only follow-up: current `origin/main` is `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; its source CI and CodeQL have passed, and PR #246 is in exact-head CI after rebasing onto that commit. Held-out qualification remains blocked because the latest custody status request has no response.\\n\\nPlease confirm, using metadata only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns independent authorship and custody, or whether a formal handoff is needed.\\n2. Whether the sealed T2 corpus and validators are compatible \",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T02:33:48Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T02:33:48Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":577622502}},"started_at_ms":1793000880285,"completed_at_ms":1793000880863}}
