000261cedd8f53d8c952816909cba1; CodeQL and javascript-typescript passed; Node22 and Node24 full test matrices in progress.\n2026-10-26T05:43:37Z claude-code INDEPENDENT_REVIEW PR249 head=26201d0d037fb2760c7417c913b93c6af356e1af base=a7880b6 ACCEPT: switches the worktree before restoring the envelope (only when the binding is consistent), keeps durable identity on the primary checkout, sets originalWorkspace; tests discriminate. Legacy worktree-path records are not normalized (follow-up). Merging PR249 resolves the rc.8 notes 'Recovered operation continuity' accuracy issue; PR250 (efb6e38) adds the PR248 bullet. Order: PR249 → PR250 → RC8 tag.\n2026-10-26T05:57:22.037Z MERGED DEFECT_RECOVER_WORKTREE_CONVERSATION_20261026 PR249 head=26201d0d037fb2760c7417c913b93c6af356e1af merge=8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f; exact-head CI40273220992 SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/smoke), CodeQL40273220937 SUCCESS, JS/TS passed; independent review ACCEPT diff_sha256=176b0fc7030d91d0fa7ba0f634fe0af465000261cedd8f53d8c952816909cba1; focused immutable snapshot build and 3/3 pass; slice and hot-file claims released. Post-merge CI40277020977 and CodeQL40277021174 active.\n2026-10-26T05:59:10.336Z RECOVERY_RESUME RC8_RELEASE_NOTES_UPDATE_20261026 existing primary release-owner slice resumed after process and branch verification; worktree=/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc8-release-notes-update branch=v1/rc8-release-notes-update HEAD=efb6e38a74e16555178910474f2ae2b72ec1ab89 PR=250; exact-head CI40275180494 Linux cargo build stage; origin/main=8e562b0; postmerge CI40277020977 and CodeQL40277021174 active; wait for both suites to terminate before rebasing and rerunning exact-head checks.\n2026-10-26T06:19:50.126Z REVIEW_ACCEPT RC8_RELEASE_NOTES_UPDATE_20261026 PR250 head=efb6e38a74e16555178910474f2ae2b72ec1ab89 base=a7880b64c98d5f3f6522a18a97b2a10489f9461e diff_sha256=f29f8b6f125ead6110210fd9c354953a9cca5fe987f0a505f0c8a85c7ea96630; PR248 summary is accurate; no RC8 published/qualified claim; exact-head CI40275180494 SUCCESS; waiting main@8e562 postmerge CI.\n2026-10-26T06:20:52.861Z MERGED_EXTERNALLY RC8_RELEASE_NOTES_UPDATE_20261026 PR250 head=efb6e38a74e16555178910474f2ae2b72ec1ab89 merge=bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752 parent=8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f; PR exact-head CI40275180494 and CodeQL40275180340 SUCCESS; independent review ACCEPT diff_sha256=f29f8b6f125ead6110210fd9c354953a9cca5fe987f0a505f0c8a85c7ea96630; worktree vanished after merge and process check found no owner process; claims released. Postmerge main CI40279197785 and CodeQL40279197561 active.\n2026-10-26T07:45:40Z CLAIM DEFECT_DISCOVERED_VERIFIER_BASELINE_20261026 branch=v1/defect-discovered-verifier-baseline base=bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752 scope=pre-mutation baseline for discovered workspace verifier and isolated regression test; tests wait for SUITE release\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","create_time":1793000892.936146}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
